    <div style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; width: 42px; height: 42px; border-radius: 10px; background: #f59e0b22; color: #f59e0b; font-weight: 800; font-size: 1.05rem; margin-bottom: 14px;">01</div>
    <h3 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 10px; line-height: 1.4;">Mid-month:</h3>
    <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;">Booking your bike transport in the middle of the month can sometimes result in better deals compared to booking at the end of the month. This is because carriers may have more availability mid-month due to fewer demands. Moreover, they might reduce rates to fill up available slots.</p>
  </div>
  <div style="background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.75); border: 1.5px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 14px; padding: 24px 20px; box-shadow: 0 10px 25px rgba(0,0,0,0.35); transition: transform 0.2s ease, border-color 0.2s ease;">
    <div style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; width: 42px; height: 42px; border-radius: 10px; background: #10b98122; color: #10b981; font-weight: 800; font-size: 1.05rem; margin-bottom: 14px;">02</div>
    <h3 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 10px; line-height: 1.4;">Month-end:</h3>
    <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;">On the other hand, booking near the end of the month can sometimes offer discounts as carriers aim to clear out their slots before the new month. However, be prepared for higher demand and shorter slots due to more people moving during this time.</p>
  </div>
</div>

	<ul style="list-style: none; padding-left: 0; margin: 18px 0;">
		<li style="margin-bottom: 10px; display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 10px;"><i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color: #10b981; margin-top: 5px; flex-shrink: 0; font-size: 0.95rem;"></i><span><strong>Early booking:</strong> Many transport services offer discounts for advance reservations, especially when booked several weeks or months in advance. By planning ahead and making your reservation well before the move date, you can save money on transportation costs.</span></li>
		<li style="margin-bottom: 10px; display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 10px;"><i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color: #10b981; margin-top: 5px; flex-shrink: 0; font-size: 0.95rem;"></i><span><strong>Group bookings:</strong> If you have multiple bikes to transport, consider grouping them together. Some carriers may offer discounts for large volumes or booking multiple bikes at once.</span></li>
	</ul>

	<ul style="list-style: none; padding-left: 0; margin: 18px 0;">
		<li style="margin-bottom: 10px; display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 10px;"><i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color: #10b981; margin-top: 5px; flex-shrink: 0; font-size: 0.95rem;"></i><span><strong>Flexible Payment Options:</strong> Some bike transport services offer flexible payment schedules, allowing you to pay in milestones or installments. By spreading the payment over a period, you can avoid paying the full amount upfront and reduce your financial burden.</span></li>
		<li style="margin-bottom: 10px; display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 10px;"><i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color: #10b981; margin-top: 5px; flex-shrink: 0; font-size: 0.95rem;"></i><span><strong>Insurance Premiums:</strong> When opting for insurance coverage, consider paying the premium in milestones instead of paying it all at once. By dividing the insurance premium over multiple payments, you can potentially save on the total cost.</span></li>
	</ul>
	<p>By utilizing these strategies, you can save money when transporting your bike from Ratnagiri to Pune. Remember to research and compare different transport services to find the best deals and payment options that fit your budget and transportation needs.</p>
	<p>Here are some tips to optimize these strategies:</p>
	<ol>
		<li style="margin-bottom: 10px; display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 10px;"><i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color: #10b981; margin-top: 5px; flex-shrink: 0; font-size: 0.95rem;"></i><span>
